      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokwa kw’omomura o Yeroboamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eria Abiya, omomura o Yeroboamu akarwara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Yeroboamu agateebia mokaye: “Imoka, bwekone ase ogwetuba, erinde tomanyekana ng’a aye moka Yeroboamu; ogende Silo. Ahiya omobani nao akare, oria ontebetie ng’a nimbe omorwoti igoro ase abanto aba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oire amo naye emegati ikomi, na amaandasi, na obooke egetono ekemo, ogende asare; ere nagoteebie egento kegochia gokororekana ase omwana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moka Yeroboamu akaimoka akagenda Silo, agacha ase enyomba y’Ahiya. Bono Ahiya tarenge korora, ekiagera amaiso aye konya oukoire ase engencho y’obogotu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agakwana n’Ahiya, akamoteebia, “Rora, moka Yeroboamu ngocha are gokoboria amanye igoro y’omwana oye ore omorwaire. Aya na aya naro oramoteebie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekero omokungu oria achete asare agekora buna omokungu omoao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero Ahiya aigwete eriogi ri’amagoro aye agotitiria, na ekero omokungu oria arenge gocha ase egesieri, Ahiya akamoteebia, “Inchuo soa nyomba, aye moka Yeroboamu! Nase ki ogwekora koba buna omokungu omoao? Nachikirwe kogoteebia amang’ana amakong’u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genda oteebie Yeroboamu: Aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Nakoimokereretie igoro korwa ase egati y’abanto, naende ngakobeeka okaba omoraai bw’abaanto baane Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende ngatandorana oborwoti, nkaborusia korwa ase enyomba ya Daudi, ngakoboa aye, korende aye tobeti buna Daudi, omosomba one arenge, oria orendete amachiiko aane, na agantunyana nenkoro yaye yonsi. Ere agakora onsi ayare amaronge ase amaiso aane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende aye gwakorire ayare amabe goetania baria bonsi bagotang’anerete. Naende gwekoreire chinyasae ching’ao, na kweroiseirie emegwekano enyititoire na kobombwa, na igo kwangechirie goika nabeire nendamwamu kwangire na konyeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, rora, nindete obobe igoro ase enyomba yao aye Yeroboamu, ninsirie kegima kera omonto omosacha korwa ase enyomba yao, abasomba amo nabatari abasomba, ase egati y’Abaisraeli. Ninsirie kegima enyomba yao aye Yeroboamu, buna omonto akwabusa obonyira bwarua, kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto onde bwensi bw’enyomba ya Yeroboamu orakwere ase omochie ime, chisese nachimorie, na onde bwensi orakwere isiko aarabu, chinyoni chia igoro nachimorie, ekiagera Omonene nere okwanire ring’ana eri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase ayio, genda nka bwoo. Ekero amagoro ao agosoa ase omochie omwana oria nakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli bonsi mbamoreere na komotindeka. Omwana oria bweka ase eamate ya Yeroboamu, nere oratindekwe ase embeera ime, ekiagera asere oyi’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, ororire egento kiamogokirie korwa ase enyomba ya Yeroboamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Omonene nechorere omorwoti oragaambere Abaisraeli, na omorwoti oyio nasirie kegima enyomba ya Yeroboamu, na ayio nakoreke korwa bono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene naake Abaisraeli abanyegerie buna egetonto gekonyegerigwa ime ase amaache, nabasimore barue ase ense eye engiya aete chisokoro chiabo, abasiarere gochia ng’umbu y’Eufarati, ekiagera barabwo bakorire emete y’Asera, enyasae yabo enkuungu, na igo bagechirie Omonene obeire nendamwamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere natige Abaisraeli ase engencho y’ebibe ebi Yeroboamu akorete, akagera Abaisraeli bagakora ebibe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio moka Yeroboamu akaimoka, akagenda Tirisa, na ekero agotamboka omoriibo o inse bw’egesieri ki’enyomba omwana oria agakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Abaisraeli bonsi bakamotindeka na komoreera, koreng’ana buna ring’ana riri’Omonene akwanete goetera ase omobani Ahiya, omosomba oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokwa kwa Yeroboamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi Yeroboamu akorete, buna arwanete chiseegi, na buna agambete, nigo ariikire ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroboamu akaba okogaamba ase engaki y’emiaka emerongo ebere, na ebere. Erio akaraara ase chisokoro chiaye chiararete, na Nadabu, omwana oye omomura, akaba okogaamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 11:5—12:15)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Rehoboamu, mosinto o Sulemani, akagaambera Abayuda. Ekero achagete kogamba konya okoorire emiaka emerongo ene nomo, akaba okogaamba ase engaki y’emiaka ikomi, na etano na ebere, agwo Yerusalemu, omochie ori’Omonene achorete korwa ase egati y’ebisaku bionsi bi’Abaisraeli, erinde abeeke erieta riaye aroro. Ng’ina Rehoboamu nigo arenge korokwa Naama, omosubati bw’Abaamoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayuda bagakora ayare amabe ase obosio bw’Omonene, bakagera akaba nendamwamu ase engencho y’ebibe biabo bakorete ebinge goetania ebi bionsi chisokoro chiabo chiakorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakeagachera aase aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa, ne chisiiro, na emete y’Asera, enyasae yabo enkuungu, igoro ase ebigoro bionsi na inse ya kera omote omobese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbaarenge aroro ase ense eria abasacha abanyaka bakarigania ase obosooku. Abanto abwo bagakora okogechia konde gwonsi okwo abanto b’ebisaku biri’Omonene aseretie korwa ase Abaisraeli baarenge gokora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka o gatano bw’okogaamba kwa Rehoboamu, Sisaki, omorwoti o Misiri, agacha, akarwania Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaira chikungo chionsi chi’enyomba y’Omonene na echi’enyomba y’omorwoti, akaira kera egento. Boigo akaira chinguba chionsi chi’etaabu, chiria Sulemani aroisetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Rehoboamu omorwoti akagoncha chinguba chi’etai ribaga rie chinguba chiria chi’etaabu, agachibeeka ase amaboko ’abanene b’oborendi, baria baarenge korenda egesieri ki’enyomba y’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Botambe ekero omorwoti arenge gosoa ase enyomba y’Omonene, abarendi nigo baarenge gochibogoria, naende bachiirania ase enyomba y’oborendi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
