          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu akaraara ase chisokoro chiaye chiararete, agatindekwa aase chiatindegetwe, ase Omochie o Daudi. Ng’ina Rehoboamu nigo arenge korokwa Naama, omosubati bw’Abaamoni. Abiyamu, omwana oye omomura, akaba okogaamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
